Compare finalized snapshots without treating missing observations as deletion

Usage: aws-inventory diff [OPTIONS] --before <BEFORE> --after <AFTER>

Options:
      --db <DB>                [default: inventory.sqlite]
      --before <BEFORE>        
      --after <AFTER>          
      --limit <LIMIT>          [default: 100]
      --max-items <MAX_ITEMS>  [default: 100000]
  -h, --help                   Print help
